From: AshesTom <258768419+AshesTom@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] user32, gdi32, ntdll: the imports of XP's Common Controls 6

Purpose: XP's comctl32 6 standard controls (with patch 0170's GWLP_WOWWORDS)
run without calling unimplemented functions.
XP behavior: they import user32's DrawFrame, MBToWCSEx and WCSToMBEx, gdi32's
QueryFontAssocStatus (0 without font association) and SetLayoutWidth, and
ntdll's RtlRunEncodeUnicodeString and RtlRunDecodeUnicodeString (a password
edit keeps its text run-encoded).
Wine before: stubs or missing exports; an Edit aborted in
QueryFontAssocStatus, a framed Static in DrawFrame.
Change: implement them.
Scope: all processes.
---
